# Scrumfolks TMS

Monorepo: `frontend/` (Next.js) + `backend/` (FastAPI). Production is Railway from GitHub `main`.

Read `CURSOR_CONTEXT.md` before auth, session, email, tasks, or brands work.

- Sign-in is email + password only. Never restore demo role buttons on `/login`.
- Never commit secrets or `SEED_PASSWORD`.
- Never set `RESET_WORKSPACE=true` on production unless the user asks.
- Browser → `/api/*` proxy → FastAPI `/api/v1/*`. No direct DB from the UI.
- Session is HttpOnly cookie `sf_sess` issued by FastAPI. Same `JWT_SECRET` on both apps.
- Prices: Owner and Accountant only. Managers see billable flags, not rupees.
- Clock-in required before task status/progress/review.
- Prefer editing existing modules over new parallel systems.
